# Profiling artifacts
cargo-flamegraph.trace/
*.svg
# Exception: the benchmark atlas ships SVG on purpose. It is documentation, not
# a profiling artefact, and the PNG encoder in the matplotlib build that made
# these figures produces a raster whose text layer decodes badly.
!docs/plots/atlas/*.svg
Cargo.lock
/semver-checks/
